0.2 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (hide yes)) (property "Notes" "PCB LAYOUT 左到右1/2/3，均passive；未查到U/V/W定义。PTH Ø2.70; NPTH矩形定位槽0.60x1.50mm使用Edge.Cuts闭合内开槽，无电气编号，不以圆头钻槽冒充矩形；制造需包含Edge.Cuts。规格书未给出焊脚高度数字，目录写 3.0 mm，未从图纸尺寸线读出。铜焊盘外径未查到，按名义孔两侧各0.65mm环宽推定4.00mm；本体公差、原点到前后沿未查到，包络推定见批次文档；无准确 STEP。Library definition only; no prototype." (at 330.2 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (hide yes)) (property "LCSC" "C19268044" (at 330.2 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (hide yes)) (pin "1" (uuid "a41dc182-48a5-5536-a0a1-8bb43fa92c29")) (pin "2" (uuid "f78e329b-42cc-5b3a-bebc-559592028dbe")) (pin "3" (uuid "5e22e82c-09ab-51a1-b98a-954f9bbbbbac")) (instances (project "inverter" (path "/c6bbe498-7a84-5001-ab1e-dd9afbac55ac/122d50e7-f4bd-50e5-9e7e-d7a23c9d1345" (reference "J4") (unit 1)))))
