(text "J4：1=U、2=V、3=W；上边缘布局见 #4。\n线端 MR60-F（C3040681）不上板。J5 焊线孔保持。" (at 269.24 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2b157292-a1d2-580a-868c-3d44bcb40c0f"))
(text "U32 S8：1 GATE / 2 SOURCE / 3 NC / 4 IN / 5 SHDN / 6 VSS / 7 NC / 8 OUT。\nSHDN 接 IN 常使能；VSS 按 ADI 图4经 R215=1k 回到 GND；C213 跨 OUT/VSS。\nD212 栅源齐纳 12 V；D213/D214 共阳极，分别钳位输入正/负瞬态（原厂推荐拓扑）。" (at 20.32 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left top)) (uuid "18b7e8bf-4f2d-5ba9-ae53-1aca989f92d7"))
